{"id":"62d90cad1e2c67e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-order7-antitone-map.md","title":"ZFC Order7 Antitone Map","display":"df-zfc-order7-antitone-map — ZFC Order7 Antitone Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order7-antitone-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order7-antitone-map"],"display":"df-zfc-order7-antitone-map — ZFC Order7 Antitone Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order7-antitone-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order7-antitone-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order7-antitone-map — ZFC Order7 Antitone Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Y\\times Y\">\\(S\\subseteq Y\\times Y\\)</span> (partial orders, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AntitoneMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AntitoneMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}antitone\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AntitoneMap}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(Y,S)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle f(b),f(a)\\rangle\\in S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}antitone\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AntitoneMap}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(Y,S)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle f(b),f(a)\\rangle\\in S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the source and target relations are required to be partial orders; the displayed implication then states order reversal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ and $S\\subseteq Y\\times Y$ (partial orders, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:X\\to Y$ (function, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq Y\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7AntitoneMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}antitone\\text{-}map} 